[h1]Pack Medic[/h1]
Your medic ran out of first aid kits in the middle of a fight, and the garru standing right next to them has fifty in its backpack. Not anymore: [b]medics take a kit from the nearest pack animal and keep healing[/b].

[h2]⚠️ REQUIRES RE_KENSHI[/h2]
This is an [b]RE_Kenshi plugin[/b] (a DLL). Without RE_Kenshi it does nothing.
[list]
[*][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/kenshi/mods/847]RE_Kenshi v0.3.5 or newer[/url][/b] ([url=https://github.com/BFrizzleFoShizzle/RE_Kenshi/releases]GitHub[/url]) — install it first, then subscribe here and enable [b]PackMedic[/b] in the launcher.
[/list]

[h2]How it works[/h2]
Once per second the mod checks your squad. For every character with the [b]Medic[/b] or [b]Repair Robots[/b] job:
[list]
[*]if they have no kit of the right kind (in their inventory or the backpack they wear),
[*]and someone in the squad needs first aid, a splint or robot repair,
[*]the nearest pack animal in the same squad hands over [b]one[/b] kit — the best one it carries, from its inventory or its backpack.
[/list]
They go right back to healing on their own. If the kit doesn't fit in their inventory, it stays on the animal.
[list]
[*][b]Medic[/b] → first aid kits and splint kits
[*][b]Repair Robots[/b] → robot repair kits (skeleton repair kits)
[/list]
[b]Medics also apply splints on their own[/b]: when someone nearby needs one, the medic gets a "Splint Injuries" order, just like your click (at most one order per medic and per patient every 20 seconds). The game doesn't let "Splint Injuries" be a permanent job, so the Medic job does it.
Nothing happens while nobody is hurt, so a medic who also works a medical bench won't empty your garru into a crate.

[h2]Settings[/h2]
[i]Kenshi\mods\PackMedic\settings.txt[/i] (or the Workshop folder):
[list]
[*][b]@range[/b] — max distance between the medic and the animal (default 1000; about 30 is standing side by side).
[*][b]@interval[/b] — how often the squad is checked, in milliseconds (default 1000).
[*][b]@debug[/b] — 1 writes every step to [i]RE_Kenshi_log.txt[/i].
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Single-player.
[*]Doesn't change any game data, so load order doesn't matter. Works with Genesis and backpack mods.
[*]Safe to add or remove mid-game: it stores nothing in your save.
[/list]

[h2]Open source[/h2]
Source code, issues and changelog on GitHub: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-pack-medic]github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-pack-medic[/url]
